    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.statusline\n\n### Question\n\nAs mentioned in the title, I would like **every window's statusline** to have the _filename be relative to the PWD_; laststatus is set to 2. I've seen #1463, but I already have that behaviour for single windows. The problem lies w/ multiple windows at once.\r\n\r\n### Vim (desired behaviour):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c569716-6337-4123-afa1-6770c1c975d3\" />\r\n\r\n### Neovim:\r\n\r\n#### Manual\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8245cc56-08b2-4c2e-b59e-5a6c88835cc6\" />\r\n\r\n#### MiniStatusLine.section_filename()\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2472\" height=\"1584\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/927de81f-9f42-4a3f-b23e-b8ae9174b507\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have tried using both MiniStatusLine.section_filename() and some expansion magic, but to no avail.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n\t{\r\n\t\t\"nvim-mini/mini.statusline\",\r\n\t\tversion = false,\r\n\t\topts = {\r\n\t\t\tuse_icons = false,\r\n\t\t\tset_vim_settings = false,\r\n\t\t\tcontent = {\r\n\t\t\t\tactive = function()\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal mode, mode_hl = MiniStatusline.section_mode({ trunc_width = 512 })\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal git = MiniStatusline.section_git({ trunc_width = 75, icon = \"\" })\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal diff = MiniStatusline.section_diff({ trunc_width = 75, icon = \"\" })\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal diagnostics = MiniStatusline.section_diagnostics({\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttrunc_width = 75,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\ticon = \"\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tsigns = { ERROR = \"!\", WARN = \"?\", INFO = \"@\", HINT = \"*\" },\r\n\t\t\t\t\t})\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t-- TODO: Get name w.r.t PWD\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal pathname = vim.bo.buftype == \"terminal\" and \"%t\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tor \"%#MiniStatuslineFilename#\" .. vim.fn.expand(\"%:t\") .. (vim.bo.modified and \" [+]\" or \"\")\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal fpath\r\n\t\t\t\t\tfpath = MiniStatusline.section_filename({ trunc_width = 512 })\r\n\t\t\t\t\tfpath = pathname\r\n\t\t\t\t\t---\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal devinfo\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif git == \"\" then\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdevinfo = diff == \" -\" and \"\" or diff\r\n\t\t\t\t\telse\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdevinfo = git .. (diff == \" -\" and \" \" or (\" │\" .. diff))\r\n\t\t\t\t\tend\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn MiniStatusline.combine_groups({\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = mode_hl, strings = { mode } },\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = \"MiniStatuslineDevinfo\", strings = { diagnostics } },\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"%<\", -- Mark general truncate point\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = \"MiniStatuslineFilename\", strings = { fpath } },\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"%=\", -- End left alignment\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = \"MiniStatuslineDevinfo\", strings = { devinfo } },\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = mode_hl, strings = { \"%-2l,%-2v\" } },\r\n\t\t\t\t\t})\r\n\t\t\t\tend,\r\n\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t},\r\n\t},\r\n\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.statusline</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As mentioned in the title, I would like <strong>every window's statusline</strong> to have the <em>filename be relative to the PWD</em>; laststatus is set to 2. I've seen <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"7788011\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1463\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1463/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1463\">#1463</a>, but I already have that behaviour for single windows. The problem lies w/ multiple windows at once.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Vim (desired behaviour):</h3>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/62666332/500132472-2c569716-6337-4123-afa1-6770c1c975d3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..w61SHxpiAz12D2Tv9R9s8LGfH29IW1v9n02zuV1N-fI\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1250\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/62666332/500132472-2c569716-6337-4123-afa1-6770c1c975d3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..w61SHxpiAz12D2Tv9R9s8LGfH29IW1v9n02zuV1N-fI\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1250px;; aspect-ratio: 2000 / 1250; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Neovim:</h3>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Manual</h4>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/62666332/500132675-8245cc56-08b2-4c2e-b59e-5a6c88835cc6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kcEVJU6oPnZTEpgYgx9GtkZiU2wY1X0Dh7OAVqP88Eg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1250\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/62666332/500132675-8245cc56-08b2-4c2e-b59e-5a6c88835cc6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kcEVJU6oPnZTEpgYgx9GtkZiU2wY1X0Dh7OAVqP88Eg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1250px;; aspect-ratio: 2000 / 1250; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">MiniStatusLine.section_filename()</h4>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/62666332/500133177-927de81f-9f42-4a3f-b23e-b8ae9174b507.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..pwbu7oNEdSrQII-G0a_mzFvLCraSEYLv7QNNwJcBTuQ\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1282\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/62666332/500133177-927de81f-9f42-4a3f-b23e-b8ae9174b507.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..pwbu7oNEdSrQII-G0a_mzFvLCraSEYLv7QNNwJcBTuQ\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1282px;; aspect-ratio: 2000 / 1282; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have tried using both MiniStatusLine.section_filename() and some expansion magic, but to no avail.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"\t{\n\t\t&quot;nvim-mini/mini.statusline&quot;,\n\t\tversion = false,\n\t\topts = {\n\t\t\tuse_icons = false,\n\t\t\tset_vim_settings = false,\n\t\t\tcontent = {\n\t\t\t\tactive = function()\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal mode, mode_hl = MiniStatusline.section_mode({ trunc_width = 512 })\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal git = MiniStatusline.section_git({ trunc_width = 75, icon = &quot;&quot; })\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal diff = MiniStatusline.section_diff({ trunc_width = 75, icon = &quot;&quot; })\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal diagnostics = MiniStatusline.section_diagnostics({\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttrunc_width = 75,\n\t\t\t\t\t\ticon = &quot;&quot;,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tsigns = { ERROR = &quot;!&quot;, WARN = &quot;?&quot;, INFO = &quot;@&quot;, HINT = &quot;*&quot; },\n\t\t\t\t\t})\n\n\t\t\t\t\t-- TODO: Get name w.r.t PWD\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal pathname = vim.bo.buftype == &quot;terminal&quot; and &quot;%t&quot;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tor &quot;%#MiniStatuslineFilename#&quot; .. vim.fn.expand(&quot;%:t&quot;) .. (vim.bo.modified and &quot; [+]&quot; or &quot;&quot;)\n\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal fpath\n\t\t\t\t\tfpath = MiniStatusline.section_filename({ trunc_width = 512 })\n\t\t\t\t\tfpath = pathname\n\t\t\t\t\t---\n\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal devinfo\n\t\t\t\t\tif git == &quot;&quot; then\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdevinfo = diff == &quot; -&quot; and &quot;&quot; or diff\n\t\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdevinfo = git .. (diff == &quot; -&quot; and &quot; &quot; or (&quot; │&quot; .. diff))\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\t\treturn MiniStatusline.combine_groups({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = mode_hl, strings = { mode } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = &quot;MiniStatuslineDevinfo&quot;, strings = { diagnostics } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&quot;%&lt;&quot;, -- Mark general truncate point\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = &quot;MiniStatuslineFilename&quot;, strings = { fpath } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&quot;%=&quot;, -- End left alignment\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = &quot;MiniStatuslineDevinfo&quot;, strings = { devinfo } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = mode_hl, strings = { &quot;%-2l,%-2v&quot; } },\n\t\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\tend,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t},\n\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">\t{\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>nvim-mini/mini.statusline<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">version</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>,\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">use_icons</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>,\n\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">set_vim_settings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>,\n\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">content</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-en\">active</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode_hl</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniStatusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">section_mode</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">trunc_width</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">512</span> })\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">git</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniStatusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">section_git</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">trunc_width</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">75</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">icon</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">diff</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniStatusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">section_diff</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">trunc_width</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">75</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">icon</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">diagnostics</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniStatusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">section_diagnostics</span>({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">trunc_width</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">75</span>,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">icon</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">signs</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">ERROR</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>!<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">WARN</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>?<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">INFO</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>@<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">HINT</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n\t\t\t\t\t})\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> TODO: Get name w.r.t PWD</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">pathname</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bo</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">buftype</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>terminal<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%t<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%#MiniStatuslineFilename#<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">..</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">expand</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%:t<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">..</span> (<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bo</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">modified</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> [+]<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">fpath</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">fpath</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniStatusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">section_filename</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">trunc_width</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">512</span> })\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">fpath</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">pathname</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">---</span></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">devinfo</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">git</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">devinfo</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">diff</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> -<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">diff</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">else</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">devinfo</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">git</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">..</span> (<span class=\"pl-smi\">diff</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> -<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> <span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> (<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> │<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">..</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">diff</span>))\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniStatusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">combine_groups</span>({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">hl</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode_hl</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">strings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">hl</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniStatuslineDevinfo<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">strings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">diagnostics</span> } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%&lt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Mark general truncate point</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">hl</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniStatuslineFilename<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">strings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">fpath</span> } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%=<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> End left alignment</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">hl</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniStatuslineDevinfo<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">strings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">devinfo</span> } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ <span class=\"pl-smi\">hl</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode_hl</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">strings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%-2l,%-2v<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>} },\n\t\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t},\n</pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.statusline\nQuestion\nAs mentioned in the title, I would like every window's statusline to have the filename be relative to the PWD; laststatus is set to 2. I've seen #1463, but I already have that behaviour for single windows. The problem lies w/ multiple windows at once.\nVim (desired behaviour):\n\nNeovim:\nManual\n\nMiniStatusLine.section_filename()\n\n\nI have tried using both MiniStatusLine.section_filename() and some expansion magic, but to no avail.\n\t{\n\t\t\"nvim-mini/mini.statusline\",\n\t\tversion = false,\n\t\topts = {\n\t\t\tuse_icons = false,\n\t\t\tset_vim_settings = false,\n\t\t\tcontent = {\n\t\t\t\tactive = function()\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal mode, mode_hl = MiniStatusline.section_mode({ trunc_width = 512 })\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal git = MiniStatusline.section_git({ trunc_width = 75, icon = \"\" })\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal diff = MiniStatusline.section_diff({ trunc_width = 75, icon = \"\" })\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal diagnostics = MiniStatusline.section_diagnostics({\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttrunc_width = 75,\n\t\t\t\t\t\ticon = \"\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\tsigns = { ERROR = \"!\", WARN = \"?\", INFO = \"@\", HINT = \"*\" },\n\t\t\t\t\t})\n\n\t\t\t\t\t-- TODO: Get name w.r.t PWD\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal pathname = vim.bo.buftype == \"terminal\" and \"%t\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tor \"%#MiniStatuslineFilename#\" .. vim.fn.expand(\"%:t\") .. (vim.bo.modified and \" [+]\" or \"\")\n\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal fpath\n\t\t\t\t\tfpath = MiniStatusline.section_filename({ trunc_width = 512 })\n\t\t\t\t\tfpath = pathname\n\t\t\t\t\t---\n\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal devinfo\n\t\t\t\t\tif git == \"\" then\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdevinfo = diff == \" -\" and \"\" or diff\n\t\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdevinfo = git .. (diff == \" -\" and \" \" or (\" │\" .. diff))\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\t\treturn MiniStatusline.combine_groups({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = mode_hl, strings = { mode } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = \"MiniStatuslineDevinfo\", strings = { diagnostics } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"%<\", -- Mark general truncate point\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = \"MiniStatuslineFilename\", strings = { fpath } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"%=\", -- End left alignment\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = \"MiniStatuslineDevinfo\", strings = { devinfo } },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ hl = mode_hl, strings = { \"%-2l,%-2v\" } },\n\t\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\tend,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t},",
